.TH GTASKS-WINDOW 1 "2026-09-10" "gtasks-panel 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gtasks\-window \- see and change Google Tasks in a GTK window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gtasks-window
.br
.B gtasks-window
.B \-\-window
.br
.B gtasks-window
.B \-\-quit
.br
.B gtasks-window
.B \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gtasks-window
shows your Google Tasks. It uses the same sign-in as
.BR gtasks-panel (1),
so you sign in one time only.
.PP
The panel item runs this command on every click. The first process stays
alive and every later start hands its arguments to it over D-Bus. The
window is therefore fast from the second click on.
.SH CLICK ON THE PANEL ITEM
.TP
.B "single click"
A small popup opens under the pointer. It lists the open tasks with a
check button for each one, a field to add a task, a list chooser, and a
button that opens the full window. A second single click closes it. The
popup also closes on Escape or when it loses the focus.
.TP
.B "double click"
The full window opens: task lists on the left, tasks in the middle,
the details of the chosen task on the right. There you can add tasks,
change the title, the notes and the due date, mark tasks done, move a
task to another list, and delete a task.
.PP
Two clicks count as a double click when they are less than 400
milliseconds apart, or less than twice the GTK double-click time when
that is larger.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-window
Open the full window at once. The desktop menu entry uses this.
.TP
.B \-\-quit
Stop the window process. Use it one time after a package upgrade: the
old process keeps running and the panel click would go to it.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version.
.SH SIGN IN
When there is no OAuth client file, the window shows the path to put it
at and the steps to make one. When there is no token, or the token
expired, the window shows a
.B "Sign in"
button. The button runs
.B "gtasks-panel \-\-auth"
as a child process, which opens a browser.
.SH OFFLINE
The window keeps the last answer from Google in a cache file. Without a
network it shows the cache and a bar that says
.IR "Offline. Showing saved tasks." .
Changes are turned off until the network is back.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CACHE_HOME/gtasks-panel/tasks.json
Every task list and task of the last query. The window shows this first.
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/gtasks-panel/window.json
Size of the full window.
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/gtasks-panel/token.json
Saved sign-in. Shared with
.BR gtasks-panel (1).
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/gtasks-panel/config.ini
Optional settings. The key
.I default_list
gives the title of the list a new task goes to.
.SH NOTES
Delete is permanent in Google Tasks. The window waits 8 seconds behind an
.B Undo
bar before it sends the delete.
.PP
Sub-tasks are shown indented. This version cannot change the parent of a
task and cannot reorder tasks by hand.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gtasks-panel (1),
.BR xfce4-panel (1)
